# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# VERIFICATION NOTE: these logs were produced by ccpa/airplayd, which for the
# on-hardware validation REUSES ANOTHER PROJECT’S CarPlay receiver as the harness —
# ncm_carplayd/receiver_core (its proven ControlServer for pair-setup/verify + auth-setup,
# and, for the full-session capture, its AvSession for SETUP/RECORD/stream handling).
# This proves the session works on the adapter; it is NOT the committed final design,
# which forwards the ENCRYPTED A/V + the session key over OCBM to the host app (no on-box
# decode/IPC). MFi is our own LocalMfiSigner on the genuine local i2c chip. See ./README.md.
